      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DOTTIE KEEPING (7) is a well performed dog and winner of 14 races who is worth forgiving after finishing out of the placings at Richmond (22.94). Form here at the trip excellent including seven wins. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Should be very hard to beat this time. ROSACKY RAYO (1) scored two back in quick then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 2 length 4th at Gunnedah (25.30). Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. ARMOURED GLASS (2) boasts a strong record this journey with eight wins and five minors from 14 tries. Recorded a 2.75 lengths win (18.42) in a NG last time at this track. Can hit the frame with the right run. AMAZING GEM (8) won as expected last time and is sure to feature again.",
